Z||000001||FieroPerformance||12-10-2001||05:00 PM||||Here is one that my dad and I made. It is for an 8" Rockford Fosgate HX2 (peaks at 800 watts - RMS is 400 watts). It sits in the footwell and the sub faces up and away from the passengers feet. The back of the box doubles as a foot rest.<P>I am considering making a few more and selling them on the forum if there is enough demand and if I can get a decent amount of money for them. It is VERY solid, reinforced wherever possible. Its made out of MDF (denses than fiber board).<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mybox1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mybox2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mybox3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mybox4.jpg"> <P>-Charlie<BR>----------- <A HREF="http://www.customcellularproducts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.customcellularproducts.com</A> <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsigfperformance.jpg"> ||||reg||1
