Z||000005||Rare87GT||12-11-2001||01:47 AM||||Hey stimpy your box looks very nice and looks like it even leaves the passenger side with enough foot room.  How wide is your box total from the back of the box to the front.  I have a 12" sub but it is taking up a lot of the foot space on the passenger side.  I don't really know if it is possible to cut it more or would it make it sound worse.  And what do you think about putting the 12" sub behind the passenger side?  Would a 12" even fit.  Thanks.<P>------------------<BR>1987 GT (Maroon)*5 Speed*<BR>(Canadian Car)<BR>2.8L Mods--No Cat, K&N||||reg||1
